      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vergennes%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Otter Creek Falls powered early mills and factories, making Vergennes a 19th‑century industrial hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
